.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.B int mystrlen(const char *str);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrlen
calculates and returns the number of characters in the specified
string, excluding the terminating null character.
